// golden_test.go — T-42: the generated-golden differential for the
// GitHub per-repo loop's pure surfaces — the batch scorecard, the
// reports' file formats, the LLM prompt + ladder, the credibility and
// reputation batteries, and the model picker.
//
// testdata/githubpipeline.golden.json is generated by
// testdiff/goldens/dump_githubpipeline.py from the unmodified
// reference (assadigit/GitCurator @ 98f4fc7, the pinned venv's CPython
// 3.12.15 stdlib) with the reports module's clock frozen at
// 2026-10-17 12:00:00 — no per-run facts inside. The GUI-layer import
// stubs (PyQt6 / PyGithub / ollama as minimal sys.modules shapes, the
// reference's own mock.patch discipline) satisfy the import machinery
// only; the worker CODE is unmodified.
//
// THE LAW: goldens are never hand-edited; a divergence is either a Go
// bug (fix the port) or a reference behavior change (regenerate + say
// so in the commit).
